; ted-setdefs-flags-lsl7 (#383): setdefs shifts the words of the option
; file into the flags of the check gadgets (lsl #7) without masking them
; to bit 0.  L:blitzeditor.opts with makeicons 2: the Icons gadget (id 9)
; gets $0100 = GFLG_DISABLED.  OPTIONS, teddrive logs the gadgets of the
; requester with their flags, CANCEL.  Correct: the gadget has the flags
; of makeicons 0 (2 masked to bit 0); the original has it disabled.
; @source none
; @opts makeicons=2
; @expect log "gadget id 9 type $00000001 flags $00000000"
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
menu 0 3
wait req "OK" "CANCEL"
gad 27
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
